SkillName: {
	MagicMissileSkill: Magic Missile
	MultiMissileSkill: Multi-Shot
	AshenWitchSkill: Ashen Witch
	MagicBarrierSkill: Magic Barrier
	WindBladeSkill: Wind Blade
}

SkillDesc: {
	MagicMissileSkill:
		'''
		Deals {0} magic damage to the target.
		Passive: After Magic Missile hits 5 times consecutively, it deals additional damage equal to 200% of Magic Missile's damage and restores {1}% of lost Magic. If Magic Missile directly kills an enemy, it also restores some Magic.
		'''
	MultiMissileSkill: Deals magic damage to the target.
	AshenWitchSkill:
		'''
		When enabled, Ashen Witch lets Elaina use unique [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic]. Her extra life gain is reduced by 50%. When Magic is insufficient, each 1% of maximum life restores 1% of maximum Magic.
		Magic regenerates at a fixed combat rate, refills in about two seconds outside combat, and pauses for three seconds after taking damage. Mana potions do not restore it.
		'''
	MagicBarrierSkill:
		'''
		[c/FF6B6B:Prerequisite: Ashen Witch (must be unlocked and enabled)]

		While enabled, reduces final damage by the fraction of maximum life removed by Ashen Witch.

		Direct hits and each actual damage-over-time tick use the same percentage reduction, consuming Magic equal to absorption before rounding. Remaining damage is rounded down; damage below 1 is fully blocked.
		Insufficient Magic pays for partial absorption before these rounding rules apply, without converting life into Magic.
		For example, reducing maximum life from 500 to 300 grants 40% damage reduction while Magic is sufficient. Life recovery is unchanged.
		'''
	WindBladeSkill: Deals {0} magic damage to the target.
}

